Viktor, 07.10.2026:
- «В комнате Писателя добавить глобальный экспорт/импорт всех данных скопом для бекапа». In the notebook's bar, the disk
  (Export all) and the folder (Import): the lab's export (every document with its versions, the takes made from it, the
  trash) saved as one file named for the day; a backup brought back through the lab's import (what is missing comes in,
  the same is left alone, a document that differs comes in beside its namesake as a copy; nothing written over), its
  count in a toast. Both ways the file stays text in the page: a seed of 19 digits in a document's knobs would come out
  rounded through the browser's numbers. The bar's buttons stay whole, the two side by side, a row more when needed.
- «Может к хуям убираем из Композера VAE блок. В карте трека оставляем кнопки… Выбор VAE переносим в бар в спадающее меню
  прямо под выбор модели»: the ☰ menu has a VAE row right under the model (Standard, Legacy, Blend · add-on; its tip says
  the three and that a take decodes again from its card in seconds). The Composer shows no VAE block; its radios stay as
  the page's record of the choice (profiles, Open, the Writer's params and the request read it), the menu and they in
  step both ways. The Engine card says «… picked in the ☰ menu» (the six catalogs' pattern renamed with it).
- «То поле в блоке семплера вообще нужно убрать и передавать туда секундное значение»: the music's Max tokens is not on
  the page: Max length (Sound and output) sets it, 25 tokens a second, as it did since 1167.
- «Если курсор стоит в блоке редактора лирики или стиля, можем перехватывать Ctrl+F, чтобы искать не по всей странице, а
  только в активном блоке?»: heresy-find.js. Ctrl+F in the Creator's lyrics and style and the Writer's style, lyrics and
  notes opens a find bar over the box's top edge (inside it when there is no room above): the words, which match of how
  many, previous, next, close; Enter and Shift+Enter (F3) go through the matches, the one in hand marked over the box
  where its letters stand (a copy of the box's layout measures them, wrapped lines too) and scrolled into view; Esc puts
  the cursor back with it selected; a click elsewhere closes it. His hand finds as plain words: a stress mark is not
  looked for (обещано finds обе́щано), ё is е, о and а find ע and the Latin o and a. Ctrl+F anywhere else is the browser's.

New words English only, for the pass before 2.0.0. The suite: 376 passed, 0 failed (the VAE checks read the menu now; the
(i) checks use Sliders', the VAE's having left with its block; the Writer's backup and Ctrl+F checked; the mock answers
the Writer with the lab's own lab/writer.py on a folder of its own).

